==Battleground==
*1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*4 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 4~6.67 seconds<sup>120f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Saki Matsuga & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~12 seconds<sup>200f~360f</sup>.
**20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A relatively simple stage. The enemies are all fairly weak even on 3-Crown difficulty. Use cats liks [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and you shouldn't have any issues.

